WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.089 --> 00:00:09.340
Monday was Dr. Martin Luther King Jr. day,
and, as is the case with almost everything

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:14.350
lately, virtually everyone on social media
seemed to parse out MLK's words for whatever

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:17.539
narrative they're currently trying to push
in our modern times.

00:00:17.539 --> 00:00:22.630
I saw articles on how MLK was the first environmentalist,
how he was an ardent feminist, a communist,

00:00:22.630 --> 00:00:24.740
a socialist and much more.

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:30.360
The one quote I tweeted of his is perhaps
his most famous: "I have a dream that my four

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:35.039
little children will one day live in a nation
where they will not be judged by the color

00:00:35.039 --> 00:00:39.399
of their skin, but by the content of their
character."

00:00:39.399 --> 00:00:45.120
I believe this quote to be as relevant now
as it was in the early 1960's, but for a whole

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:47.200
other set of reasons.

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:52.710
In the 60's, MLK was fighting for equality
under the law and equality of opportunity,

00:00:52.710 --> 00:00:56.080
two things we should all believe in.

00:00:56.080 --> 00:01:01.570
Today, those who judge people by the color
of their skin and not the content of their

00:01:01.570 --> 00:01:07.730
character are fighting not for equality, but
for special treatment of some at the exclusion

00:01:07.730 --> 00:01:09.040
of others.

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:13.770
This misguided principle - thinking you should
treat someone differently because of their

00:01:13.770 --> 00:01:18.540
skin color, or thinking someone should believe
what you think they should believe because

00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:24.759
of their skin color, or any other immutable
characteristic - is the essence of prejudice

00:01:24.759 --> 00:01:26.819
which means to prejudge.

00:01:26.819 --> 00:01:33.109
This is the complete reverse of what MLK stood
for, and sadly, this way of thinking has infected

00:01:33.109 --> 00:01:35.459
the modern Left almost wholly.

00:01:35.459 --> 00:01:41.279
This is why like myself, so many of you find
yourselves on the outside of a political bubble

00:01:41.279 --> 00:01:42.680
you were once safely a part of.

00:01:42.680 --> 00:01:47.110
For this Direct Message though, I don't want
to focus on the flaws of identity politics.

00:01:47.110 --> 00:01:50.969
Instead, I want to focus on one of the other
topics I just mentioned...

00:01:50.969 --> 00:01:51.989
socialism.

00:01:51.989 --> 00:01:56.529
And for the purposes of this message, I want
to put aside whether MLK was a capitalist

00:01:56.529 --> 00:02:00.279
or a communist or a socialist or a hybrid
of any of these.

00:02:00.279 --> 00:02:04.909
What I want to discuss is some of the reaction
around the word socialism itself.

00:02:04.909 --> 00:02:10.700
The amount of people I see talking about socialism
positively is actually staggering.

00:02:10.700 --> 00:02:15.670
A tweet I sent out saying socialism isn’t
cool even got me into a little exchange on

00:02:15.670 --> 00:02:20.580
Twitter with the official verified Socialist
Party, who explained to me that socialism

00:02:20.580 --> 00:02:25.340
has never actually been tried which is why
we don't know if it will work yet.

00:02:25.340 --> 00:02:29.099
Perhaps they should tell that to the people
of Venezuala right now, who are fighting for

00:02:29.099 --> 00:02:35.879
food and basic services as they watch their
socialist system collapse on top of them.

00:02:35.879 --> 00:02:40.560
The ideas of socialism, that the means of
production, distribution and labor should

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:46.140
be owned, controlled and regulated by the
community as a whole are the worst sort of

00:02:46.140 --> 00:02:48.780
collectivist ideas which exist.

00:02:48.780 --> 00:02:54.219
The very implication that the group knows
what is good for the individual, that we exist

00:02:54.219 --> 00:03:00.750
to do things for the greater good, is totally
antithetical to the purpose of being human.

00:03:00.750 --> 00:03:06.280
It's your job to find value in your work,
to strive for more than you have, to bring

00:03:06.280 --> 00:03:12.690
good to yourself and the people around you
and to live as a free person as you see fit.

00:03:12.690 --> 00:03:18.110
The very idea that you should set aside your
individuality for the community as a whole,

00:03:18.110 --> 00:03:25.209
which virtually always turns into an intolerant
hostile mob, is exactly why so many have died

00:03:25.209 --> 00:03:27.420
in socialist regimes.

00:03:27.420 --> 00:03:32.719
Despite the obvious failures of socialism,
socialists have no problem using the freedoms

00:03:32.719 --> 00:03:34.920
of capitalism against itself.

00:03:34.920 --> 00:03:39.040
This is perhaps the most perverse part of
the socialist world view.

00:03:39.040 --> 00:03:45.049
Much like Islamism, socialism wants to use
our freedoms against us until it attains complete

00:03:45.049 --> 00:03:46.049
power.

00:03:46.049 --> 00:03:50.950
For example, they use the tools of Twitter
and Facebook, companies created through the

00:03:50.950 --> 00:03:57.810
ingenuity of individuals and the freedom of
capitalism, to attack the very system they

00:03:57.810 --> 00:03:58.810
live in.

00:03:58.810 --> 00:04:02.870
By the way, I'm all for them being able to
do this even if I don't like what they're

00:04:02.870 --> 00:04:03.870
doing.

00:04:03.870 --> 00:04:08.640
That's the tricky part of freedom, it even
applies to people and ideas you don't like.

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:13.129
Just think for a moment if we had a socialist
government in charge...how do you think it

00:04:13.129 --> 00:04:16.709
would be going for free expression and free
speech?

00:04:16.709 --> 00:04:21.870
How tolerant would they be of all the people
they label nazis and bigots?

00:04:21.870 --> 00:04:26.539
Whatever you may think of Trump and the evil
capitalists, are they the ones coming for

00:04:26.539 --> 00:04:28.290
anyone's speech?

00:04:28.290 --> 00:04:30.449
Are reporters being put in jail?

00:04:30.449 --> 00:04:35.560
Actually, President Obama used the espionage
act to put a record number of reporters in

00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:40.919
jail, and as for as I know, Trump, who dislikes
the press to put it mildly, hasn't put anyone

00:04:40.919 --> 00:04:44.130
in prison for the crime of journalism.

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:50.200
Fortunately I see a major rising tide in America
based on liberty, freedom and individual choice.

00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:55.540
Note how those words themselves are somehow
thought of as evil in the socialist lexicon.

00:04:55.540 --> 00:05:02.450
Liberty, freedom, and individual choice must
all be sacrificed for the greater good...though

00:05:02.450 --> 00:05:07.520
what they're not telling you is that the greater
good is usually for the tiny minority in the

00:05:07.520 --> 00:05:09.750
elite protected class.

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:14.780
Their ideas have never worked and will never
work because a system built on stripping our

00:05:14.780 --> 00:05:19.789
humanity is in direct conflict with being
a human.

00:05:19.789 --> 00:05:24.660
I've said it before and I'll say it again,
this perfect system which they want to create

00:05:24.660 --> 00:05:30.760
can never be perfect because we humans, as
flawed as we are, are part of it.

00:05:30.760 --> 00:05:36.729
Imperfect beings can't create a perfect system,
but what we can create is a system that always

00:05:36.729 --> 00:05:40.849
does it's best to further the advancement
of human freedom.

00:05:40.849 --> 00:05:46.230
For all it's flaws, this is what capitalism
is, which is why if you're watching this from

00:05:46.230 --> 00:05:50.770
a capitalist society you should consider yourself
one of the lucky ones.

00:05:50.770 --> 00:05:55.919
Of course in America politicians don't call
themselves outright socialists, they say "Democratic

00:05:55.919 --> 00:05:57.080
socialists."

00:05:57.080 --> 00:06:02.060
This is Bernie's mantra as he calls for a
revolution of every kind, be it political,

00:06:02.060 --> 00:06:04.669
social or environmental.

00:06:04.669 --> 00:06:08.949
What Bernie forgets, or intentionally obfuscates,
is that the Democratic part of this will of

00:06:08.949 --> 00:06:13.629
course be tossed away as socialism takes root.

00:06:13.629 --> 00:06:17.319
It's also why there's no doubt in my mind
that eventually the social justice movement

00:06:17.319 --> 00:06:21.539
will turn on Bernie himself.

00:06:21.539 --> 00:06:27.319
Democracy is the enemy of socialism and Bernie
is trying to have it both ways.

00:06:27.319 --> 00:06:31.909
There's also a reason that the social justice
movement has such a socialist strain within

00:06:31.909 --> 00:06:32.909
in.

00:06:32.909 --> 00:06:38.190
Both of these movements, based on frowning
on achievement and accomplishment, and a resentment

00:06:38.190 --> 00:06:43.639
of those who break the mold, need people to
be oppressed...or at least believe they're

00:06:43.639 --> 00:06:45.349
oppressed, to survive.

00:06:45.349 --> 00:06:51.050
Creativity, free thought, and the pursuit
of your own happiness is the antidote to both

00:06:51.050 --> 00:06:54.080
social justice and socialism.

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:58.880
It's either that or a life of bitterness,
resentment, and jealousy, which in my view

00:06:58.880 --> 00:07:01.659
is less socialism and more just anti-social.

